  {
   "id": "FAM:SF-APPS-024",
   "what_failed": "Testing DRIVE-as-BEST counter vs constrained mix.",
   "why": "A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design) due to LIM:low_power_large_MDE and LIM:small_sample. The observed gap (-0.066) was below the minimum detectable effect (0.180 PPP at 80% power) for n=44."
  },
  {
