  {
   "code": "MEASURE_RELIABILITY",
   "text": "Defining 'cut-heavy' and 'drive-heavy' shapers, and the 'travel' of their roles, requires precise and reliable operationalizations. Misclassifying players or using an unreliable outcome metric would invalidate the findings."
